   - The bottom disk \( S_1 \) is at \( z = 0 \) with normal vector \( \mathbf{n} = -\mathbf{k} \).
   - The vector field \( \mathbf{F} \) at \( z = 0 \) has a \( z \)-component \( F_z = 0 \).
