To determine the radius of convergence of the power series \(\sum_{n=0}^{\infty} \frac{\sin(n) + 11^n + 6^n}{(2n)!} x^{2n}\), we analyze the general term \(\frac{\sin(n) + 11^n + 6^n}{(2n)!}\).

